## Advanced Usage Patterns

### Script Integration

```bash
#!/bin/bash
# Automated system monitoring script

RESULT=$(juno --output json system health --quick)
SUCCESS=$(echo $RESULT | jq -r '.success')

if [ "$SUCCESS" = "true" ]; then
    echo "System healthy"
    exit 0
else
    echo "System issues detected"
    echo $RESULT | jq -r '.error'
    exit 1
fi
```

